# What K816 compiles this fixture to, assembled with ca65 and linked with
# `../../atarixl.cfg`.  Sixteen bytes per line, load address in the left
# column; the zero fill past the last byte is trimmed.
#
# There is no `oracle.hex` beside this one: the original does not compile
# this source at all.  `oracle.err` is its answer - exit 134, no
# diagnostic - and `fixture.txt` says what that settles.
#
#   64 80    stz first_slot     <- FIRST is 0, and the zero-store rewrite
#                                  is what makes that visible in the bytes
#   A9 07    lda #$07
#   85 81    sta second_slot
#   60       rts

origin 2000
2000  64 80 A9 07 85 81 60
